["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Mapping Humanity From Space: NASA’s Black Marble with Dr. Miguel Román Black Marble Golden Goose Award VIIRS nadir downscaling\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-fromfirstprinc-被当成仪器故障的数据异常-竟是开罗城在斋月里的灯光变化/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/59727fbf3d73d196-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"F\"><span class=\"dur\">48:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">From First Principles</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>被當成儀器故障的數據異常，竟是開羅城在齋月裡的燈光變化</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">團隊原以為是儀器故障，耗費數年排查後才發現，開羅、安曼等城市的夜間亮度是按伊斯蘭曆而非公曆波動的，異常曲線精確對上了齋月的開齋節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">衛星遙感</span><span class=\"tag\">夜間燈光數據</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"#889: Q&amp;A with Tim — How to Get Unstuck, Resilience in Hard Times, Tools for Brain Health, Finding Inner Peace, Optimism as a Learnable Skill, and More IFS (Internal Family Systems) fear setting hemoglobin A1c Zone 2 training\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-timferriss-行动的风险被高估了-不行动的代价才被低估/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/4859313b1789a4e8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:14:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Tim Ferriss</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>行動的風險被高估了，不行動的代價才被低估</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">寫下一年、三年、十年不改變會發生什麼，那幅畫面通常比你想像中更可怕——這比盤算風險更能推動你做出真正的改變。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">行為改變</span><span class=\"tag\">阿爾茨海默病預防</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Too dry for cacti: extreme droughts could push iconic species to extinction severe drought model CAD obesity (combined anthropometric definition of obesity) IUCN Red List\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-naturepod-仙人掌没你想得那么耐旱-极端干旱下四分之一物种会丢掉八成栖息地/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9b247947db171866-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"N\"><span class=\"dur\">24:29</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Nature Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>仙人掌沒你想得那麼耐旱：極端乾旱下四分之一物種會丟掉八成棲息地</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">仙人掌被當作抗旱標杆，但研究者把極端乾旱納入氣候模型後發現，近四分之一物種將損失超過八成適宜棲息地，遠超常規氣候模型的預測。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">氣候變化</span><span class=\"tag\">生物多樣性</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"A New Vision for Human Work After Automation GDPval agency rupture allocation economy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-aiandi-ai-让生成答案变得廉价-稀缺的是你带着视角去追问/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8c79a115d7e2b3b6-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">26:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">AI &amp; I（Every）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI 讓生成答案變得廉價，稀缺的是你帶著視角去追問</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">當所有人都能從 Claude 拿到同樣的默認答案，真正值錢的不是模型能力本身，而是你因為責任和視角而去追問出的那個不一樣的答案。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI 自動化</span><span class=\"tag\">未來工作</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Credit Cards EMV chip Charga-Plate coverture usury law Fresno Drop\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-stuffmissed-美国银行1958年给整座城市邮寄6万张信用卡-不用申请/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:01</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美國銀行1958年給整座城市郵寄6萬張信用卡，不用申請</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">1958年美國銀行給弗雷斯諾6萬居民直接寄去信用卡，不問資質、沒有申請——這場豪賭幾乎讓銀行賠到破產，卻意外開啟了全國性信用卡時代。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">信用卡</span><span class=\"tag\">消費金融</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Agents That Think Together: Cisco&#x27;s Vijoy Pandey on Semantic Alignment, Scope, Accord &amp; Concord Internet of Cognition Scope Accord / Concord GATs / COGs neuralese / latent space communication\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-cogrev-多智能体系统仪表盘全绿-但任务完成率为零/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0ad67f662e5c86c3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:31:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>多智能體系統儀表盤全綠，但任務完成率為零</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Cisco發現一個多智能體系統在儀表盤上顯示66%在線、運行正常，實際任務完成率卻是0%——因為現有監控只檢查連接狀態，不檢查語義是否對齊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多智能體系統</span><span class=\"tag\">企業AI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"What the Internet Boom Teaches Us About the AI Buildout | Mike Volpi WDM stat-muxing neocloud KV cache model router\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-a16z-ai算力终将被用尽-但资产的主人很可能会换人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">56:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>AI算力終將被用盡，但資產的主人很可能會換人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">上一輪光纖泡沫裡，負債最重的公司率先破產，但光纖資產被別人接手後照樣好用；Mike Volpi 認為這輪 GPU 建設會重演同一劇本——資產會被充分利用，歸屬權卻很可能換人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力週期</span><span class=\"tag\">GPU資產</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.135律政佳人轉行賣饅頭 年入4億 聊聊早餐創新的秘密 PB\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-nengzheduolao-水饺有巨头-包子馒头没有-因为机器学不会捏褶子的手感/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/08bfa83c9f3d2123-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"能\"><span class=\"dur\">1:08:35</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">能者多嘮｜商業原聲</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>水餃有巨頭，包子饅頭沒有，因為機器學不會捏褶子的手感</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">水餃湯圓早被思念三全這樣的巨頭規模化吃下，包子饅頭卻因為發麵要靠手工捏褶，機械做不出那種蓬鬆感，十年來始終留給小品牌生存空間。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">食品消費</span><span class=\"tag\">供應鏈</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Zach Reitano - Building Ro and Why Healthcare Should Be 50% of GDP - [Invest Like the Best, EP.500] PBM Overton window demand aggregator strong attract, strong repel\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-ilt-美国医疗的核心病根-病人掏钱-却从来不是真正的客户/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c02f9f6b43abc39b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"I\"><span class=\"dur\">1:16:07</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Invest Like the Best</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>美國醫療的核心病根：病人掏錢，卻從來不是真正的客戶</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Ro創始人認為醫療支出該儘量高，因為真問題不是花了多少錢，而是病人從沒當過真正的客戶——GLP-1用現金自付證明了這一點。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">醫療</span><span class=\"tag\">GLP-1</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Perfect Storm That Clobbered Hedge Funds multi-strat / pod negative gamma CTA de-grossing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-oddlots-标榜-不相关-的对冲基金-十月却因同押ai集体巨亏/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">51:58</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>標榜「不相關」的對沖基金，十月卻因同押AI集體鉅虧</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">十月裡幾乎所有主流策略的對沖基金同時虧錢，說明過去一年多數人賺的其實是隱性做多AI的錢，而非真正分散的策略收益。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">對沖基金</span><span class=\"tag\">多策略基金</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Chickenology (HENS &amp; ROOSTERS) Part 2 Encore with Tove Danovich pecking order lash egg bumblefoot broody gizzard\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-ologies-公鸡其实没有阴茎-一个叫bmp4的蛋白质在胚胎期把它杀死了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">47:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>公雞其實沒有陰莖：一個叫BMP4的蛋白質在胚胎期把它殺死了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">雞蛋的顏色、受精與否、營養價值幾乎都由品種決定而非「天然程度」，但工業化養殖為效率犧牲了孵蛋本能，也讓斷喙和啄癖成為普遍爭議。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">後院養雞</span><span class=\"tag\">動物行為</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Vol.35 對話朱嘯虎：Personal Agent 是個偽需求？ Personal Agent ARR Vibe Coding Open-weight model\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-guijilichang-你自己都没有秘书-为什么需要一个ai秘书/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/38d8d27c2f34d3c1-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"硅\"><span class=\"dur\">22:40</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">硅基立場</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>你自己都沒有秘書，為什麼需要一個AI秘書</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">朱嘯虎認為日常工作99.9%不需要頂級大模型，開源模型的token消耗量終將超過閉源；但Personal Agent缺少高頻場景，很可能重蹈十年前補貼打車的覆轍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI應用</span><span class=\"tag\">基座模型經濟學</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"20.建築師戚山山：人生不是“既要又要還要”，而是“我就要這個” safe play\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-11-tanpai-建筑师不与别人竞争-只跟一百个自己赛跑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/68d3da25c54fc635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"攤\"><span class=\"dur\">1:21:50</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">攤牌｜創業觀察</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1111</span></div>\n<h2>建築師不與別人競爭，只跟一百個自己賽跑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">她說自己從不覺得在卷，是因為壓根沒有要卷的對象——建築師戚山山的生命力不是自律撐出來的，而是先問自己到底喜不喜歡，再決定做不做。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">建築</span><span class=\"tag\">女性創業者</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Freedom vs. Safety: Axon CEO Rick Smith on the Future of Policing ALPR\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-allin-axon-ceo-警用无人机未来该配非致命武器-而不是枪/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/561dcd474c610c53-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">55:36</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">All-In</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Axon CEO:警用無人機未來該配非致命武器，而不是槍</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Axon 主張用無人機和機器人搭載非致命武器取代警察持槍對峙，開火權仍歸人類，但要多人實時審批才能啟動。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>10</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">安防科技</span><span class=\"tag\">創業史</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Episode 344: Philosophy as Dialogue Seventh Letter aporetic dialogue divine madness\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-verybad-柏拉图说真正的哲学教诲根本不能被写下来/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/de9fabd2316045b0-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"V\"><span class=\"dur\">1:17:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Very Bad Wizards</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>柏拉圖說真正的哲學教誨根本不能被寫下來</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">柏拉圖在《第七封信》裡說自己從未寫下真正的哲學教誨，因為哲學不完全是命題，而是一種經驗；對話體之所以存在，正是為了承載寫不下來的那部分。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">柏拉圖</span><span class=\"tag\">哲學方法論</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Designing for Agents — Zeno Rocha, Resend MCP AEO/GEO Domain Connect SES llms.txt\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-latentspace-体量大100倍的对手-却被下载量反超-规模不是护城河/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/af0f478aa0a3653b-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">1:25:52</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Latent Space</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>體量大100倍的對手，卻被下載量反超：規模不是護城河</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沒有郵件背景的創始人靠產品體驗把下載量反超，而發明DevRel的Twilio收購SendGrid後卻把它晾在一邊。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">郵件基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">MCP</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Neuron Basis: Goodfire&#x27;s Curt Tigges on Agentic Interp, Monosemanticity &amp; Reverse Engineering gated MLP (SwiGLU) monosemanticity ablation SAE (sparse autoencoder) neuron scientist\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cogrev-单个神经元的含义没有想象中混乱-智能体逐个审问找到答案/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cd1b0999555e3944-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:56:17</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>單個神經元的含義沒有想像中混亂：智能體逐個審問找到答案</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">門控MLP讓神經元只在少數幾個含義間切換而非上百種混雜；AI智能體逐一做實驗驗證後，能用一段描述準確預測神經元的行為，推翻了「神經元太髒讀不懂」的舊說法。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">可解釋性</span><span class=\"tag\">大模型</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"How Washington keeps helping China catch up in AI | Luisa Rodriguez distillation wakesurfer\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-eightythousand-中国ai没有自研超车-靠的是租美国算力-抄美国模型/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ad5a0c87762b8e27-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"8\"><span class=\"dur\">26:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">80,000 Hours</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>中國AI沒有自研超車，靠的是租美國算力、抄美國模型</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">中國模型只落後美國約六個月，但這差距很大程度靠境外租用英偉達芯片和對美國模型的知識蒸餾撐起來——一旦美國堵住這兩條路，真實差距會比看起來大得多。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">出口管制</span><span class=\"tag\">芯片租賃</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"HubSpot’s Co-Founder on Finding Your Next Startup Idea Yellow Brick Road second brain context graph evals\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-a16z-chatgpt和claude已是新操作系统-但护城河不在界面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">58:57</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>ChatGPT和Claude已是新操作系統，但護城河不在界面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">HubSpot聯合創始人判斷：模型正趨於可替換的基礎設施，沒有人能卡住創業者的供應鏈咽喉；真正的護城河是沉澱下來的工作與數據，而非用戶進入的那個聊天框。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">AI基礎設施</span><span class=\"tag\">平臺生態</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Nik Storonsky: The most uncompromising banking CEO K-factor NPAP (New Product Approval Process) OCC\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cheekypint-revolut-ceo-把银行信贷类比卖期权-收十年租金-一年亏光/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d2ccbd206c41a7e-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"C\"><span class=\"dur\">51:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Cheeky Pint</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>Revolut CEO 把銀行信貸類比賣期權：收十年租金，一年虧光</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">放貸利潤會被經濟週期一次性抹平，所以 Revolut 把放貸目標壓到資產負債表不到10%、其餘證券化出表，寧可做訂閱制科技公司，也不做傳統淨息差銀行。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">新型銀行</span><span class=\"tag\">產品運營</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Jensen Huang on Leading Nvidia, Developing a Flat Management Style, and Keeping Humans in the Loop retrieval augmentation human in the loop accelerated computing\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-ch-harvard-business-review-黄仁勋-公司砍掉3到4层管理-只为信息跑得比摩尔定律快/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/0b5e55c5474113a9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">26:25</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Harvard Business Review</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>黃仁勳：公司砍掉3到4層管理，只為信息跑得比摩爾定律快</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">NVIDIA 的扁平化不是管理時尚，而是因為加速計算十年能提速十萬倍，信息必須無障礙流動，層級一多就跟不上。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">NVIDIA</span><span class=\"tag\">組織管理</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Shadi Hamid and Matthew Kaemingk on Whether Democracy Needs Religion idolatry political hobbyism\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-goodfight-政治变得越世俗-反而越像一场圣战/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>政治變得越世俗，反而越像一場聖戰</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">兩位作者認為，當人們不再從宗教獲得身份認同與終極意義，這種渴望並未消失，而是轉移進了政治——這正是美國政治走向「聖戰化」的根源。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">宗教與政治</span><span class=\"tag\">政黨政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"How Elon Musk Solves Problems | Jon McNeill battlefield promotion bill of materials weighted ETF Follow Me Home exercise Fire Yourself exercise\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-knowledge-马斯克的产品算法-自动化是最后一步-不是第一步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/586a4f39f9c67632-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:46:30</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">The Knowledge Project</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>馬斯克的產品算法：自動化是最後一步，不是第一步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">特斯拉團隊曾因為先自動化而在同一個問題上卡住數月：馬斯克的算法要求先刪需求、簡化流程、手動跑通，自動化永遠是最後一步。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">特斯拉</span><span class=\"tag\">馬斯克</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"515 從鐵幕創作到解凍文藝：漫談世界電影史中的波蘭巨匠安傑伊·瓦伊達 Zespół filmowy\" href=\"/podcast/tw/p/2026-11-10-cn2aa250-波兰电影史其实是电影节写出来的-没进戛纳就等于没拍过/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/cb6acd126210dffb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"忽\"><span class=\"dur\">1:22:47</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">忽左忽右</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1110</span></div>\n<h2>波蘭電影史其實是電影節寫出來的：沒進戛納就等於沒拍過</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究者說大衛·波德威爾寫羅馬尼亞電影史時一個字都沒提，不是因為片子差，而是因為那些片子從沒被送到西方能看見的電影節。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要點</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">波蘭電影</span><span class=\"tag\">冷戰文化政治</span>\n</div></div></a>"]